WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:04.167
-Guys, it's Thursday. You wanna do a little "Roses and Thorns"?

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.934
-Oh, yeah. -Yeah. Let's go around the room.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:06.901
Check in. I'll go first.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.100
My rose is I ordered

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.100
a brand-new flat-screen TV for the Super Bowl.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.534
-Oh. -Yeah.

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:14.501
-My thorn is it was being delivered

00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:15.834
by that Chinese balloon.

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:18.667
-Ohh. -Yeah.

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:20.467
Higgins, do you have a rose and a thorn?

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.934
-Oh, my God. Do I ever.

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:24.601
I scored tickets to see Beyoncé in concert.

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:28.367
-Oh! You -- That's fantastic! What's -- What's the thorn?

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:29.968
-The thorn is my children

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.734
will no longer be able to attend college.

00:00:31.734 --> 00:00:33.634
-Oh, that's terrible. That's sad.

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.200
Uh, Mark, how about you, bud?

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.634
-Yeah, uh, my rose is, at lunch today

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:39.667
I got an extra Chicken McNugget in my order.

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:42.200
-Oh, that's good! That's -- That's lucky.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.934
That's good. What's the thorn?

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:46.367
-My thorn is, I was eating at Chipotle.

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:49.434
-Ohh. -I gotcha.

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:51.567
James, you want to finish us off here?

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:52.901
-Yeah.

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:55.000
My rose is my wife booked a dinner reservation

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.234
for Valentine's Day.

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:59.734
-Ohh! That's good. I like that. What's the thorn?

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:04.200
-My thorn is, it's with our pool boy, Geraldo.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.968
-Maybe we shouldn't do "Roses and Thorns."

00:01:06.968 --> 00:01:09.534
We'll be right back with "Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:01:09.534 --> 00:01:10.801
Come on back.

